  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-23T11:51:08.075Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The issue is, if some avatar is annoying, currently we have to hide every single person that puts on that avatar.\nMy suggestion would be making two separate hiding options:\n1. Hide avatar. This would hide that avatar whenever anyone puts it on (using the id of the avatar).\n2. Hide user. This would hide any avatar the user selected puts on, basically the current \"hide avatar\" (In case someone puts annoying avatars in general).\nThis could save so much people from crashing due to a crasher avatar since they only would have to hide it once, and would avoid getting annoyed by toxic avatars in general.",
